---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Dhiraj Phuyal">
  <section class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT</span>
    <h1>Engineer first.<br /><span style="color:var(--muted)">Always curious.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I'm Dhiraj, a Software Engineer based in Kathmandu, Nepal. I like understanding
      how systems work beneath the surface and then turning that understanding into
      software people can depend on.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        My professional work is focused on US healthcare software at Cedar Gate Technologies,
        where I work with .NET, AWS, databases, data processing and monitoring systems.
        Healthcare software brings real constraints: data privacy, interoperability,
        reliability and the need to make complicated workflows understandable.
      </p>

      <h2>What I enjoy</h2>
      <p>
        I particularly enjoy problems where the obvious solution isn't quite enough:
        designing a clean boundary between systems, tracing data through an asynchronous
        workflow, understanding why a production system behaves differently than expected,
        or building a small language just to understand how languages work.
      </p>

      <h2>Outside the code</h2>
      <p>
        I'm interested in technology beyond whatever I'm currently building. I also enjoy
        painting, learning guitar, exploring places around Nepal, and spending time with
        the people close to me.
      </p>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>
        I studied Computer Science and continue to deepen my foundations in algorithms,
        data structures, object-oriented and functional programming, compiler design,
        and systems engineering.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
